# Build output from the two toolchains this project targets.
.pio/
build/
__pycache__/

# NOT ignored, deliberately: .schema.uids.json.
#
# It is the uid ledger - the record of which wire id each task owns - and it is
# as much a part of the wire contract as schema.yaml. A fresh clone without it
# re-derives every id from scratch, which is precisely the drift this project
# exists to catch. It is a dotfile because it is generator-maintained and never
# hand-edited, not because it is disposable.
